SUMMARY:Loosening the Grip: A Day of Meditation on Love and Letting Go
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nPlease consider joining me **November 14t
 h** for **silent meditation and reflection.**\n\n**Join us for the full da
 y\, the morning\, or the afternoon.**\n\n* **Morning\, 9:00 am to 12:30 pm
 :** instruction\, guided practice\, sharing\, and David's talk. Accessible
  for beginners.\n* **Lunch\, 12:30 to 1:30 pm:** held in silence on campus
 . If you are joining for the full day\, **please bring a bag lunch**. Ther
 e is space on site to heat and cool food.\n* **Afternoon\, 1:30 to 5:00 pm
 :** silent practice with little or no teaching\, best suited to those alre
 ady comfortable with silent meditation. An accessible guided option is off
 ered for newer meditators.\n\nPlease **bring your smart phone and ear buds
 ** or headphones for deep mantra listening practice.\n\nPlease sign up at 
 this link: [https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/loosening-the-grip-a-day
 -of-meditation-on-love-and-letting-go](https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketi
 ng/loosening-the-grip-a-day-of-meditation-on-love-and-letting-go)
