SUMMARY:AMPLIFY: FREE 2-DAY Voice Empowerment Workshop (online)
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n\\*\\*You must register at link below to 
 attend\, please.\n\nJoin me for a FREE transformational 2-day workshop whe
 re you'll experience firsthand the multidimensional healing power of your 
 own embodied **VOICE & hearing.** Discover how to feel **safe\, free\, and
  inspired** to express **ALL of YOU**\, release what's been holding you ba
 ck\, and step into your fullest self-expression — in your relationships\
 , intuitive abilities\, sacred service\, personal artistry\, and beyond!\n
 \n\\* Date & Time:\nNovember 16 & 17\n7:00-8:30 pm EST both nights\n\\* re
 play provided for those who sign up\n\nREGISTRATION REQUIRED:\nLearn more 
 & register here: https://devora-kalma.mykajabi.com/amplify-workshop?previe
 w_theme_id=2168104778
