SUMMARY:QHHT session with Shaman Phil
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Explore Your Inner Wisdom: A Personal Q
 HHT Session**\n\n**Join me for a private\, in-person session near Nebo\, N
 C\, based on Dolores Cannon’s Quantum Healing Hypnosis Technique (QHHT).
 **\n\n**This approximately three-hour session offers an opportunity to exp
 lore past-life experiences through guided hypnosis and connect with what t
 his practice calls your Higher Self. Bring your curiosity\, questions\, an
 d intentions as we explore insights that may support deeper self-understan
 ding and personal reflection.**\n\n**This appointment is reserved for one 
 person. Sessions take place in my home\, where we have friendly cats and a
  dog. Please let me know beforehand if you have allergies or concerns abou
 t animals. For an additional fee\, I can also arrange to meet at your home
  or a mutually agreed-upon location.**\n\n**To help you prepare\, I’ll e
 mail you a few simple activities and instructions to complete before our m
 eeting. Please provide your email address when arranging your appointment.
 **\n\n**If your plans change\, please let me know as early as possible so 
 I can offer the appointment to someone else.**\n\n**I look forward to welc
 oming you and sharing this experience.**
